   "finding": "Tests connector absence against usage-matched non-organizer absence on team offensive identity (D_A). Unmatched connector vs role D_A 0.2020 vs 0.1021, t=5.97, p=2.87e-08. Usage-matched paired dD_A +0.1151, P(conn>ctrl)=81.2%, t=6.35, p=7.35e-09, n=96. Versus terminal +0.0777, t=2.37, p=0.0261, n=25. Limited by small sample; risks MECHANICAL_FLOOR and SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER recorded."
