  {"code": "MEASURE_RELIABILITY", "text": "Single-season or short pre-absence windows give unreliable profile and gain measures."},
  {"code": "BASE_RATE", "text": "The chance that the closest-profile teammate is the largest gainer is about 1/k, so any hit rate must be compared to that baseline."},
  {"code": "MULTIPLE_TESTING", "text": "Scanning many play types and many candidate teammates per absence inflates false positives."},
